### =========================================================
### AI Follow-Up Suggestion
### POST /ai/applications/:id/follow-up-suggestion
### =========================================================

### 1. Create suggested task successfully
### Expected:
### - Status 201
### - Returns a newly created task
### - status should be TODO
### - application should equal appId
### - title, description and priority are generated by AI

POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/applications/{{appId}}/follow-up-suggestion
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### =========================================================


### 2. Call again for the same application
### Expected:
### - May create another meaningful task, or
### - Return 409 if the generated task violates the existing
###   duplicate rule: user + application + title

POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/applications/{{appId}}/follow-up-suggestion
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### =========================================================


### 3. Invalid application ObjectId
### Expected:
### - Status 400
### - Params validation error

POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/applications/not-a-valid-object-id/follow-up-suggestion
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### =========================================================


### 4. Application does not exist
### Use a valid but nonexistent MongoDB ObjectId
### Expected:
### - Status 404
### - errorCode: NO_APP

POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/applications/000000000000000000000000/follow-up-suggestion
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### =========================================================


### 5. Application belongs to another user
### Expected:
### - Status 404
### - Must not reveal whether the application exists

POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/applications/{{foreignAppId}}/follow-up-suggestion
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### =========================================================


### 6. Missing access token
### Expected:
### - Status 401

POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/applications/{{appId}}/follow-up-suggestion


### =========================================================


### 7. Invalid access token
### Expected:
### - Status 401

POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/applications/{{appId}}/follow-up-suggestion
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token


### =========================================================


### 8. Verify generated task through Task endpoint
### Expected:
### - Status 200
### - The newly generated task should appear in the list

GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
```
